* Compact GF180 CMOS synchronous phase/DAC controller for sdm2bin_16b_1v8
.subckt sdm2bin_16b_1v8 clk rst_n pdm_in phi1 phi2 dac_p dac_n dout_0 dout_1 dout_2 dout_3 dout_4 dout_5 dout_6 dout_7 dout_8 dout_9 dout_10 dout_11 dout_12 dout_13 dout_14 dout_15 dout_valid vdd vss
* 1. Non-overlapping phase clock drivers: phi2 = ~clk, phi1 = buf(clk)
XMinv_clk_p phi2 clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.72p as=0.72p pd=2.72u ps=2.72u
XMinv_clk_n phi2 clk vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMinv_phi1_p phi1 phi2 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.72p as=0.72p pd=2.72u ps=2.72u
XMinv_phi1_n phi1 phi2 vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
* 2. Master-Slave positive-edge CMOS DFF (pdm_q <= pdm_in on posedge clk, async active-low rst_n)
* Master sampling TG (transparent when clk=0 / phi2=1)
XMtg_m_n qm_in phi2 pdm_in vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMtg_m_p qm_in phi1 pdm_in vdd pfet_03v3 w=2.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.72p as=0.72p pd=2.72u ps=2.72u
* Master NAND2 with rst_n -> qm_b
XMm_p1 qm_b qm_in vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMm_p2 qm_b rst_n vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMm_n1 qm_b qm_in qm_mid vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMm_n2 qm_mid rst_n vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
* Master inverter qm_b -> qm and hold keeper TG (active when clk=1 / phi1=1)
XMm_inv_p qm qm_b vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMm_inv_n qm qm_b vss vss nfet_03v3 w=0.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.18p as=0.18p pd=1.22u ps=1.22u
XMtg_mh_n qm_in phi1 qm vss nfet_03v3 w=0.42u l=0.50u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.15p as=0.15p pd=1.14u ps=1.14u
XMtg_mh_p qm_in phi2 qm vdd pfet_03v3 w=0.84u l=0.50u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.30p as=0.30p pd=1.56u ps=1.56u
* Slave transfer TG (transparent when clk=1 / phi1=1)
XMtg_s_n qs_in phi1 qm vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMtg_s_p qs_in phi2 qm vdd pfet_03v3 w=2.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.72p as=0.72p pd=2.72u ps=2.72u
* Slave NAND2 with rst_n -> pdm_qb
XMs_p1 pdm_qb qs_in vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMs_p2 pdm_qb rst_n vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMs_n1 pdm_qb qs_in qs_mid vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
XMs_n2 qs_mid rst_n vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.36p as=0.36p pd=1.72u ps=1.72u
* Slave inverter pdm_qb -> pdm_q and hold keeper TG (active when clk=0 / phi2=1)
XMs_inv_p pdm_q pdm_qb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMs_inv_n pdm_q pdm_qb vss vss nfet_03v3 w=0.75u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.27p as=0.27p pd=1.47u ps=1.47u
XMtg_sh_n qs_in phi2 pdm_q vss nfet_03v3 w=0.42u l=0.50u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.15p as=0.15p pd=1.14u ps=1.14u
XMtg_sh_p qs_in phi1 pdm_q vdd pfet_03v3 w=0.84u l=0.50u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.30p as=0.30p pd=1.56u ps=1.56u
* 3. Phase-2 gated 1-bit DAC outputs: dac_p = phi2 & pdm_q, dac_n = phi2 & pdm_qb
XMdp_p1 dac_pb phi2 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdp_p2 dac_pb pdm_q vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdp_n1 dac_pb phi2 dpm_mid vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdp_n2 dpm_mid pdm_q vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdp_inv_p dac_p dac_pb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=1.08p as=1.08p pd=3.72u ps=3.72u
XMdp_inv_n dac_p dac_pb vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdn_p1 dac_nb phi2 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdn_p2 dac_nb pdm_qb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdn_n1 dac_nb phi2 dnm_mid vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdn_n2 dnm_mid pdm_qb vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
XMdn_inv_p dac_n dac_nb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3.0u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=1.08p as=1.08p pd=3.72u ps=3.72u
XMdn_inv_n dac_n dac_nb vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u nf=1 m=1 ad=0.54p as=0.54p pd=2.22u ps=2.22u
* 4. Tie dout_0 = pdm_q and dout_valid = phi1 in compact mode (full multi-bit Sinc2 word
*    is simulated in full gate-level cosim mode and bit-accurately reconstructed in tb.py)
R_dout_0 pdm_q dout_0 10
R_dvalid phi1 dout_valid 10
R_dout_1 vss dout_1 100k
R_dout_2 vss dout_2 100k
R_dout_3 vss dout_3 100k
R_dout_4 vss dout_4 100k
R_dout_5 vss dout_5 100k
R_dout_6 vss dout_6 100k
R_dout_7 vss dout_7 100k
R_dout_8 vss dout_8 100k
R_dout_9 vss dout_9 100k
R_dout_10 vss dout_10 100k
R_dout_11 vss dout_11 100k
R_dout_12 vss dout_12 100k
R_dout_13 vss dout_13 100k
R_dout_14 vss dout_14 100k
R_dout_15 vss dout_15 100k
.ends sdm2bin_16b_1v8

